notes: Imported from mim-queue (source_id=mediadive.ingredient:1473); no CAS-RN or
  CHEBI/NCIT match. Curator review needed. Oxoid QA specification BT-SPEC-0231 for
  CM0957 gives these 15 dry-formulation constituents as typical grams per litre on
  reconstitution; quantities may be adjusted to performance standards. Directions
  specify 35.4 g powder dissolved in 1 litre distilled water. The nominal listed sum
  is 35.4055 g (rounds to 35.4 g); water is reconstitution solvent, not a declared
  dry-product constituent. Arginine, sodium succinate, ferric pyrophosphate and Vitamin
  K remain at the source specificity. No actual batch assay or fixed constituent percentages
  are claimed.
